# Files excluded from `clasp push`.
#
# main.gs is the legacy monolithic file, kept in the repository for
# reference only (see README). Every one of its 184 functions is also
# defined in a quantum_*.gs module, and it declares no unique top-level
# constants. Because clasp pushes unlisted files after those in
# filePushOrder, main.gs loaded LAST — and in Apps Script's shared global
# scope the last definition of a function silently wins. The deployed
# script was therefore running main.gs's copies, not the modules, and the
# two had already drifted apart (syncQuantumCRM being the known case).
#
# Excluding it here makes the module files authoritative. Delete main.gs
# outright once the modules have been verified in production.
main.gs
main.gs.backup-v2.0.0

# Documentation and build tooling — not Apps Script sources.
*.md
*.docx
*.pdf
docs/**
